OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 5 APR
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch explores the
OL,6,     Gmusical paths leading to Rimsky-
OL,7,     GKorsakov's joyful Russian Easter
OL,8,     GOverture, including Shrovetide
OL,9,     Gplainchant and his star student,
OL,10,     GStravinsky.
OL,11,G1500FMusic Matters: Curtain Up -
OL,12,     FClassical Stories of Musical
OL,13,     FTheatre
OL,14,     GTenor Nicky Spence explores the
OL,15,     Gdeep and often-overlooked
OL,16,     Gconnections between classical
OL,17,     Gmusic and the world of musical
OL,18,     Gtheatre.
