OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 5 APR
OL,4,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,5,     GAlyn Shipton has the perfect mix
OL,6,     Gof jazz to soundtrack your Easter
OL,7,     GSunday, including music from Ella
OL,8,     GFitzgerald, Duke Ellington, Colin
OL,9,     GSteele, Carmen McRae & more.
OL,10,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,11,     GHannah French explores plainchant
OL,12,     Gin music for Easter, heard in its
OL,13,     Goriginal single line as a cantus
OL,14,     Gfirmus and as settings of the
OL,15,     Gtext which transition from Lent
OL,16,     Gto Easter.
OL,17,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,18,     GFrom the Chapel of King's
OL,19,     GCollege, Cambridge on Easter Day,
OL,20,     Gwith music by Wood and Elgar.
